# Source-document staging area.
#
# Drop original scans and documents in /assets; copy into /public only the ones
# that are meant to be public. This repo and the deployed site are both public,
# so a document containing anyone else's personal data — a referee's phone
# number, for instance — must never be copied across.
/assets/

# Misc
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
